{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Was that delivery really the right choice?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694350/extras/985200cae85c20dab34cff07ef306664.avif?t=1771074411\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a delivery worker assigned to a single apartment building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the designated floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process the package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is your job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>not every package should be delivered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among them, there may be packages that <strong>should be treated as anomalies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not be given the correct answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What remains are <strong>the actions you chose</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the recorded signs of <strong>variation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shadow Dwelling: Deliverance</i> is a first-person exploration horror game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >centered on routine delivery work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a delivery worker, you will return to the same apartment building</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over multiple days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk down the hallway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then decide whether to\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver the package</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take it back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694350/extras/0e57f32b089e22b1924ae9eb1901e45b.avif?t=1771074411\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Task</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no chase sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You observe lights, doors, clocks, notice boards, and object placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, you will notice contradictions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with what you remember from the day before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide how to process the package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694350/extras/ce9a02e710222e65a75be9e968ceaf3b.avif?t=1771074411\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Familiar Building That Changes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, the irregularities may feel minor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But day by day,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the apartment building begins to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standards that once felt reliable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >may no longer apply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work Reports</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each day, a work report is generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The report records only your actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the observed <strong>variations</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694350/extras/553a2b3b2f01c8ece58561c9cf2fbd84.avif?t=1771074411\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694350/extras_big/553a2b3b2f01c8ece58561c9cf2fbd84.webp?t=1771074411 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>two-choice system</strong>\u2014deliver or take back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No combat or chase mechanics</strong>, focused on observation and judgment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions may rely not only on visual changes, but on <strong>conflicts with memory</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror built on <strong>lingering unease</strong>, not jump scares</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Were you really seeing something abnormal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >was the line between \u201cnormal\u201d and \u201cabnormal\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >something <strong>you decided yourself</strong>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694350?t=1771074411","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694350?t=1771074411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694350/bff4689c9ded115c75d2e819f1d01ec0ea7a086b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771074411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694350/bff4689c9ded115c75d2e819f1d01ec0ea7a086b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771074411","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demo